37985>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
37986>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
37987>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
37988>>>>>>>        End
